[
    {
        "text": "\u7b2c\u4e09\u5341\u4e8c\u5173\uff08\u524d\uff09",
        "tag": "header",
        "key": "title_test",
        "is_skippable": true,
        "fit_mode": "BLACK_MASK"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "image": "bg_lungmen_m",
        "width": 1,
        "height": 1,
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$mist_loop",
        "key": "$mist_loop",
        "volume": 0.8,
        "crossfade": 1.5,
        "delay": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Hope I didn't keep you waiting. The L.G.D. meeting took a little longer than expected.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't worry about it, Madam Ch'en.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "(She looks like nothing ever happened...)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "How's the situation?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Our scout team has already sent back some information.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "I went through it and picked out a few things that might interest you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah, Inspector Hoshiguma...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't worry about me. I'm just going to listen in.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Continue, Amiya. It's fine.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Very well. We managed to get a lead from some Infected...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "The scout team has already confirmed that there are several Reunion hideouts in Lungmen's residential district.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "And?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "A number of Reunion squads are already planning to launch an attack against Lungmen's defenses.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "We even found an infiltration channel that Reunion had been using.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Hah. Such arrogance.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "They seem to be underestimating the L.G.D.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "What about the ruins of Chernobog?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Rhodes Island dispatched multiple recon squads there.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "While most of the residents were gone, we did find many Reunion members still active there.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "One team even had more than three encounters with Reunion forces.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "However, based upon the intel we have, we are unable to conclusively link the movements in the city to any broader Reunion operations...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "But I would recommend choosing this city as one of our important operation targets in the future.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...I see.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hoshiguma, help bring me my forms. Third drawer on the left side of my desk.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "Right now? Sure thing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog",
        "fadetime": 0.3
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.3
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Continue.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Mm, to summarize...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Rhodes Island suggests a joint operation to completely eliminate the remaining Reunion forces in Lungmen.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "No good.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "The L.G.D. will not permit it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...What? Madam Ch'en...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I said, no.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "You... are an Infected.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you carry out any more missions in the slums, you'll only cause greater disorder.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "This is our decision.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "But--",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$phone"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah, excuse me, I need to take this call...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is Amiya.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": -1
    },
    {
        "text": "Is, is this Amiya?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#6"
    },
    {
        "text": "...! Jessica?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
        "focus": -1
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, Jessica here...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jessica"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you on a stealth mission? I can barely hear you...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": -1
    },
    {
        "text": "We found them in the city ruins...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jessica"
    },
    {
        "text": "Reunion's leaders...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jessica"
    },
    {
        "text": "There are... two of them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jessica"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#6"
    },
    {
        "text": "What?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "image": "bg_cher_2",
        "width": 1,
        "height": 1,
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1507_Mephisto_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "So, you fled back here with your tail between your legs?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1504_cqbw"
    },
    {
        "text": "I am no mongrel like you and your lowly kind.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1507_Mephisto_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...If not for the fact that you completed your mission, I would have added two more scars to your filthy face.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1504_cqbw"
    },
    {
        "text": "Didn't you lose all your limbs in that explosion? I'd feel sorry making a kid like you put makeup on my face with your mouth.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1507_Mephisto_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Pah.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1504_cqbw"
    },
    {
        "text": "But let's set this aside for now... It's not doing either of us any good.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1504_cqbw",
        "name2": "char_1507_Mephisto_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll admit to that much.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then, have they taken the bait?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1504_cqbw",
        "name2": "char_1507_Mephisto_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Surely. Let's just see if that old flag-waver can bring back the real goods.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "Speaking of which, you're pretty scared of that old timer, aren't you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1504_cqbw",
        "name2": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm already in a bad mood.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1504_cqbw",
        "name2": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh my, sorry 'bout that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "But that's just before we land the catch, right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "How about we put aside our differences for the time being?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1504_cqbw",
        "name2": "char_1507_Mephisto_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Tch. Fine.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll deal with the small fry first.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1507_Mephisto_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Rhodes Island, I know you're there.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "text": "...It's impossible to hide from me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.6,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.6,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_219_meteo_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Jessica, don't!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meteorite"
    },
    {
        "text": "It could be a trap...!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meteorite"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_259_Jessica_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "He found us! We have to...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jessica"
    },
    {
        "text": "If we defeat the enemy leader... We have to...!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jessica"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$p_imp_grenade_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_explo_n",
        "delay": 0.3
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh. They really were here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "text": "Where'd you come from, little kitty~?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "text": "You can't just treat this place like your playground.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1507_Mephisto_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, you bunch.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1002_nsabr_2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yessir!!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1507_Mephisto_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Before we get to feast upon the most sumptuous prey...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "text": "Help yourself to the appetizers.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
        "name2": "char_1002_nsabr_2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ohhh... Ohhhhh! !",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_193_frostl_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Tsk...!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frostleaf"
    },
